<title>HONG KONG: Land Bank of Taiwan seen considering $100 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Land Bank of Taiwan seen considering $100 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Land Bank of Taiwan is considering a US$100 million floating rate certificate of deposit issue, bankers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The facility would have a final maturity of three or five years, they said.</p>
<p>The issuer is 100 percent owned by the Taiwan government.</p>
<p>Sources close to the transaction said the issuer's funding requirements were not urgent and that it might withdraw the issue &quot;if pricing is not satisfactory&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
